    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Hero Image -->
<section style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.5rem 3rem;">
  <div style="border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background-color:var(--page-bg);box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">
    <img src="/images/equipment/equipment-sunrise-dmu400-5axis-hero.webp" alt="SUNRISE DMU-400 五轴立式加工中心 在鑫永恒 CNC 工厂" width="1200" height="600" loading="eager" decoding="async" style="width:100%;height:auto;display:block;object-fit:cover;" />
  </div>
  <p style="font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--text-muted);text-align:center;margin-top:0.8rem;">SUNRISE DMU-400 代表机型 · 集团协作产能网络在役</p>
</section>

<!-- Narrative -->
<section style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:2rem 1.5rem;">
  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2.5rem;align-items:start;">
    <div>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand-dark);margin-bottom:1rem;text-align:right;">设备概述</h2>
      <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--text-body);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:0.8rem;text-align:right;">SUNRISE DMU-400 是一款门式结构的五轴立式加工中心，专为高精度复杂零件加工而设计。其直驱式转台在 A 轴和 C 轴上均实现零背隙平滑运动，非常适合模具型腔、高可靠性结构件、医疗零件和三维曲面加工。</p>
      <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--text-body);line-height:1.7;text-align:right;">配备高速 BBT40 主轴和臂式刀库，DMU-400 可稳定加工铝、钢及合金材料。该设备体现了鑫永恒在五轴联动加工领域的能力，为客户提供一次装夹、多面精加工的解决方案。</p>
    </div><div>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand-dark);margin-bottom:1rem;">Overview</h2>
      <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--text-body);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:0.8rem;">The SUNRISE DMU-400 is a gantry-structured 5-axis vertical machining center designed for high-precision complex part manufacturing. Its direct-drive rotary table delivers smooth, zero-backlash motion on both A and C axes, making it ideal for mold cavities, high-reliability structural parts, medical components and 3D surface work.</p>
      <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--text-body);line-height:1.7;">Equipped with a high-speed BBT40 spindle and arm-type tool changer, the DMU-400 handles aluminum, steel and alloy materials with consistent accuracy. The machine represents Eternal CNC's capability in simultaneous 5-axis machining for customers requiring single-setup, multi-sided finishing.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

